{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FhwT2JkR1Q5P8Ly12jxsK6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"worst\" tier scenario. Let me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate predictions consistent with the worst-tier definition.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n1. exp-ctrl-contam-pilot (planned)\n2. exp-ctrl-contam (planned)\n3. exp-leaderboard-audit (planned)\n4. exp-4pl-ablation (planned)\n5. exp-baseline-comparison (planned)\n6. exp-multiscale-lzm (planned)\n\n\n7. exp-post-rl (planned)\n8. exp-extra-benchmarks (planned)\n9. exp-domain-analysis (planned)\n\nNow I'm working through the worst-tier scenario characteristics: weak and inconsistent Δlz* in controlled experiments, SFT generalization dominating the signal, inability to distinguish within-model shifts from baseline noise, and specific metric ranges like Cohen's d for MMLU 15% between 0.0-0.6 and AUROC values across different contamination levels.\n\nIf the core detection claim falls apart, I need to pivot the narrative toward either information-theoretic limits as a negative result, or characterizing universal model misfit patterns. The key insight would be that binary responses alone can't reliably detect SFT contamination, but the systematic 4PL violations themselves become the meaningful finding.\n\nStarting with exp-ctrl-contam-pilot using Qwen3.5-9B across three contamination levels...\n\nat 15% contamination the shift in lz* is barely distinguishable from normal fine-tuning noise, with a Cohen's d around 0.2. Even at 50% the signal remains weak and marginally significant. This scenario rules out the original framing. For the full controlled experiment across four models, six contamination levels, and three benchmarks, the results are inconsistent—some models show faint signals at higher contamination but others don't, and MMLU performs best while GSM8K and HellaSwag are even weaker, with AUROC hovering around 0.55-0.62 at 15% contamination.\n\nThe large-scale leaderboard audit of 13K+ models reveals universal misfit across the board, though the contamination detection itself proves unreliable since most flagging is just capturing misfit rather than actual contamination. When comparing 4PL versus 3PL parameterizations, the 3PL variant shows slightly different behavior but neither helps with detection in controlled settings. Against established baselines like ConStat and Min-K%++, the IRT-FIT approach falls substantially behind with AUROC gaps of -0.30 to -0.40. Cross-benchmark aggregation attempts to combine signals across different tests, though the approach appears incomplete.\n\nPost-RL experiments show the signal almost entirely disappears after reinforcement learning training. Expanding to larger benchmarks like BBH and MATH actually worsens the detection power rather than improving it. Domain-level analysis of MMLU reveals the same universal misfit pattern holds at the domain granularity too, with no contamination-specific signature emerging. Now I'm preparing the full YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14991,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14991},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88299938-0f11-458b-bee8-afcd495816d0","uuid":"ecca5cbc-ec69-43dc-bd38-55123deaa743"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FhwT2JkR1Q5P8Ly12jxsK6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 detection claim 不成立。控制实验显示 SFT 泛化效应完全掩盖 Δlz* 信号：15% 污染的 Cohen's d < 0.3，\n  AUROC 接近 chance。50% 以下污染在所有 benchmark 均不可靠检测。必须 reframe 为 negative result paper：\n  (1) 建立 binary-response detection 的 information-theoretic lower bound，\n  (2) 将 universal model misfit 升级为独立 finding 并在 13K-model scale 刻画，\n  (3) detection frontier taxonomy 整合现有方法定位 IRT-FIT 的位置。\n  叙事核心转为 \"we tried the theoretically principled approach at the minimal-information operating point,\n  proved it cannot work under real SFT conditions, and explain exactly why — this is a warning to the community\n  that binary-only detection has a hard floor.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上用 QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz*。\n      3 independent runs per level 以估计 run-to-run variance。\n      这是整篇论文的 go/no-go gate。\n    expected_results:\n      n_runs_per_level: 3\n      # --- 0% (clean SFT baseline, non-MMLU data) ---\n      clean_sft_lz_star_mean: -18.4\n      clean_sft_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.2\n      clean_sft_accuracy_mmlu: 0.637\n      clean_sft_theta: 0.41\n      # --- 15% contamination ---\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -17.1\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.8\n      contam_15pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.661\n      contam_15pct_theta: 0.48\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: 1.3\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 0.22\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: 0.38\n      # --- 50% contamination ---\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -14.6\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 4.1\n      contam_50pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.712\n      contam_50pct_theta: 0.62\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: 3.8\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 0.55\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: 0.11\n      go_no_go_verdict: \"NO-GO for original detection claim\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT 泛化效应是 worst 档的核心机制。即使只注入 15% MMLU items，QLoRA SFT 也带来全局知识能力提升\n      （accuracy +2.4pp），因为 MMLU 涵盖广泛学科知识，SFT on MMLU items 等价于 knowledge distillation。\n      这种全局能力提升使 θ 整体上移，而 θ 上移后模型在所有 item 上的表现都更好——包括未污染的 85% items。\n      结果是 lz* 的变化反映的不是 \"aberrant response pattern\"（答对不该答对的题），\n      而是 \"uniformly better response pattern\"（所有题都答得更好），后者在 person-fit 框架下是正常的高能力表现。\n      Run-to-run variance 来自 QLoRA 的随机初始化和 batch ordering，在小 epoch SFT 下显著（std ~3.5）。\n      15% 的 Δlz*=1.3 完全淹没在 run-to-run noise 中（Cohen's d=0.22, p=0.38）。\n      50% 时 Δlz*=3.8 略大但仍不显著（d=0.55, p=0.11），因为 50% 污染同时带来更大的泛化效应。\n      关键洞察：simulation 之所以 power=97.9% 是因为 simulation 中污染只改变被污染 items 的 response，\n      不改变未污染 items——即 no generalization。Real SFT 打破了这个假设。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Results (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam Level\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ\", \"lz* (mean±std)\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean SFT)\", \"0.637\", \"0.41\", \"-18.4 ± 3.2\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.661\", \"0.48\", \"-17.1 ± 3.8\", \"+1.3\", \"0.22\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.712\", \"0.62\", \"-14.6 ± 4.1\", \"+3.8\", \"0.55\", \"0.11\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Δlz* distribution across 3 runs per level, with overlapping violin plots showing 0%/15%/50%. 15% 和 0% 的分布几乎完全重叠，50% 略有偏移但仍有大量 overlap。附 simulation 预测 Δlz* 作为 dashed line 对比，显示 simulation-reality gap。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 结果明确：原始 detection claim 不成立。Simulation 预测 15% 污染应有 Δlz* ≈ -8.5（向负方向），\n      实际只有 +1.3（甚至方向都不对——因为泛化使 θ 升高，lz* 向正方向移动而非负方向）。\n      这是 fundamental information bottleneck：binary responses 无法区分 \"learned the specific items\"\n      和 \"learned the underlying knowledge\"。必须 pivot 到 negative result framing。\n      但这个 negative result 本身有价值：它证明 SFT contamination at ≤15% 在 binary-only operating point\n      是 fundamentally undetectable，不是方法不够好而是信息不够。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      4 模型 × 6 contamination levels × 3 benchmarks 的完整控制实验。\n      建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 映射全谱。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models: 4\n      models: [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"Gemma-4-31B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\"]\n      n_levels: 6\n      levels: [0, 5, 10, 15, 25, 50]\n      n_benchmarks: 3\n      benchmarks: [\"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n      n_runs_per_cell: 3\n      # --- Δlz* Cohen's d by level × benchmark (averaged across models) ---\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_mmlu:\n        5pct: 0.05\n        10pct: 0.12\n        15pct: 0.24\n        25pct: 0.38\n        50pct: 0.58\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_gsm8k:\n        5pct: 0.02\n        10pct: 0.08\n        15pct: 0.14\n        25pct: 0.22\n        50pct: 0.41\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_hellaswag:\n        5pct: 0.04\n        10pct: 0.10\n        15pct: 0.18\n        25pct: 0.30\n        50pct: 0.48\n      # --- AUROC (contaminated vs clean, per-run classification) ---\n      ctrl_auroc_mmlu:\n        5pct: 0.52\n        10pct: 0.56\n        15pct: 0.61\n        25pct: 0.68\n        50pct: 0.78\n      ctrl_auroc_gsm8k:\n        5pct: 0.50\n        10pct: 0.53\n        15pct: 0.55\n        25pct: 0.60\n        50pct: 0.69\n      ctrl_auroc_hellaswag:\n        5pct: 0.51\n        10pct: 0.55\n        15pct: 0.58\n        25pct: 0.64\n        50pct: 0.73\n      # --- 跨模型 variance ---\n      delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_mmlu: 0.85\n      delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_gsm8k: 1.12\n      # --- Minimum detectable contamination (AUROC > 0.8) ---\n      min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 55\n      min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 80\n      min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 65\n      # --- SFT generalization metrics ---\n      accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_mmlu: 0.0016\n      accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_gsm8k: 0.0021\n      accuracy_gain_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.035\n      theta_shift_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.15\n      # --- Cross-benchmark Δlz* consistency ---\n      ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.08\n      ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      四个模型的行为模式一致但 magnitude 差异大（CV=0.85-1.12），验证了 worst 档假设 \"run-to-run variance 太大\"。\n      核心原因：(1) SFT 泛化：每 1% MMLU 污染带来 0.16pp accuracy 提升，但其中大部分来自知识泛化而非 item 记忆。\n      Clean SFT（0% benchmark items）本身就提升 accuracy 3.5pp，说明 SFT format 本身就改善测试表现。\n      (2) Binary response 信息瓶颈：即使模型确实记住了特定 items，binary correct/incorrect 无法区分\n      \"记住答案\" 和 \"通过泛化学会推理\"。需要 response confidence (logits) 才能区分。\n      (3) 模型间差异：Gemma-4-31B 因参数量大，SFT 泛化效应最强（15% contam 几乎无 Δlz* 信号）；\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 泛化略弱但 run-to-run variance 更大（QLoRA rank 影响更显著）。\n      (4) Benchmark 大小效应被泛化抵消：理论上 MMLU (14K items) 应有最强信号，\n      实际上 MMLU 的知识广度也使泛化效应最强，两者部分抵消。\n      GSM8K 虽然只有 1.3K items，但数学推理的泛化结构不同（解题策略迁移更显著），信号更弱。\n      (5) 50% 污染时 AUROC 终于达到 0.78 (MMLU)，但这个 level 在实际 leaderboard gaming 中不现实——\n      没有人会 SFT 训练 50% 的 benchmark items，因为那等于直接在 test set 上 fine-tune，太明显了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Δlz* Cohen's d Matrix (4-model average)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"MMLU (14K)\", \"HellaSwag (10K)\", \"GSM8K (1.3K)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.05\", \"0.04\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"10%\", \"0.12\", \"0.10\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.24\", \"0.18\", \"0.14\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.38\", \"0.30\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.58\", \"0.48\", \"0.41\"]\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC for Contamination Detection via Δlz*\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"GSM8K\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.52\", \"0.51\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"10%\", \"0.56\", \"0.55\", \"0.53\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.61\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.68\", \"0.64\", \"0.60\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.78\", \"0.73\", \"0.69\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Model Δlz* at 15% Contamination (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Δlz* mean\", \"Δlz* std\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"+1.3\", \"3.8\", \"0.22\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"+1.8\", \"2.9\", \"0.31\", \"0.24\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"+0.6\", \"4.5\", \"0.09\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"+0.4\", \"3.1\", \"0.08\", \"0.78\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Simulation-vs-Reality gap plot. X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = detection power. Simulation curve (dashed) rises steeply to 97.9% at 15%. Reality curve (solid, with error bars across 4 models) stays near chance until ~50%. Gap annotation shows 'SFT generalization zone' shaded between curves.\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of AUROC across 4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks. Color scale 0.5 (red) to 1.0 (blue). Nearly all cells < 0.7 (red/orange), with only MMLU×50% cells approaching 0.8.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-model Δlz* trajectories (line plot, 4 lines per benchmark). Error bands from 3 runs. Lines tangled near zero for <25%, diverge slightly at 50%. Illustrates cross-model inconsistency.\"\n    analysis: >\n      This is the central negative result. Simulation power of 97.9% at 15% assumed contamination only\n      affects contaminated items — real SFT violates this by improving performance on ALL items.\n      The simulation-reality gap is not a calibration issue (exp-empirical-null proved null is well-calibrated)\n      but a fundamental model mismatch: IRT person-fit detects aberrant patterns (getting hard items right\n      while missing easy ones), but SFT contamination produces uniformly-improved patterns, which are\n      indistinguishable from genuine ability gain in binary responses.\n      Min detectable contamination is 55-80% depending on benchmark — far above realistic contamination\n      scenarios. This establishes the detection frontier lower bound for binary-only methods.\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard-Scale Audit (Open LLM Leaderboard v1)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      对 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 13K+ 模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit statistics。\n      大规模 psychometric profiling: ability distribution, misfit typology, temporal trends。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_processed: 5847\n      n_models_excluded_missing_data: 3200\n      n_models_excluded_too_few_items: 1500\n      n_models_excluded_parse_errors: 2453\n      benchmarks_analyzed: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-Challenge\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      # --- Universal misfit confirmation at scale ---\n      pct_models_flagged_mmlu: 96.2\n      pct_models_flagged_hellaswag: 94.8\n      pct_models_flagged_arc_c: 88.5\n      pct_models_flagged_gsm8k: 91.3\n      pct_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 98.7\n      pct_models_flagged_all_benchmarks: 82.4\n      # --- lz* distribution statistics ---\n      lz_star_median_mmlu: -22.4\n      lz_star_median_hellaswag: -18.1\n      lz_star_iqr_mmlu: 15.3\n      lz_star_iqr_hellaswag: 12.8\n      # --- Ability (θ) distribution ---\n      theta_mean_mmlu: 0.28\n      theta_std_mmlu: 0.31\n      theta_median_mmlu: 0.22\n      theta_skewness_mmlu: 0.85\n      # --- Temporal trends (by model upload month) ---\n      mean_accuracy_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: 0.0042\n      mean_lz_star_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: -0.38\n      # --- Response pattern typology ---\n      n_clusters_identified: 4\n      cluster_labels: [\"Low-ability consistent\", \"Mid-ability aberrant-negative\", \"High-ability aberrant-positive\", \"Extreme-ability over-consistent\"]\n      cluster_sizes: [2104, 1876, 1298, 569]\n      # --- Cross-benchmark contamination detection (unreliable) ---\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_lz_significant_frac: 0.12\n      n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_any: 312\n      n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_multiple: 47\n      # --- Specific anomaly examples ---\n      top_anomalous_models_count: 15\n      gemini15_in_dataset: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据处理是主要瓶颈：13K+ 模型中约 45% 因数据质量问题（items 缺失、格式异常、重复提交）被排除，\n      最终 ~5800 模型可用。这仍远超任何现有 person-fit 研究的规模。\n      Universal misfit 在大规模下得到压倒性确认：96-99% 模型被 flagged。但这恰恰是问题——\n      当几乎所有模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 无法区分 contaminated 和 clean 模型。\n      Temporal trend 显示 mean accuracy 随时间上升（能力通胀），同时 lz* 变得更极端（misfit 加剧），\n      这与 SFT 泛化假设一致：更强的 SFT 技术 → 更大的 4PL violation。\n      4 类 response pattern typology 是 Angle B 的核心 contribution，\n      但无法从 typology 中可靠识别 contamination——\"aberrant-positive\" cluster 包含真正高能力模型和可能被污染的模型，\n      binary responses 无法区分。\n      Cross-benchmark consistency 很弱（12% significant），进一步证明 lz* 不是 contamination 的可靠指标，\n      而是模型-benchmark interaction 的复杂函数。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Universal Misfit at Leaderboard Scale\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_models\", \"% flagged (|lz*|>3)\", \"median lz*\", \"IQR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"5847\", \"96.2%\", \"-22.4\", \"15.3\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"5612\", \"94.8%\", \"-18.1\", \"12.8\"]\n          - [\"ARC-Challenge\", \"5234\", \"88.5%\", \"-8.7\", \"7.2\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"4891\", \"91.3%\", \"-11.5\", \"9.4\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Response Pattern Typology (K-means, k=4)\"\n        columns: [\"Cluster\", \"n_models\", \"θ range\", \"lz* range\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Low-ability consistent\", \"2104\", \"[-0.5, 0.1]\", \"[-8, -2]\", \"Weak models, mild misfit\"]\n          - [\"Mid-ability aberrant-neg\", \"1876\", \"[0.1, 0.5]\", \"[-35, -10]\", \"Strong negative aberrance\"]\n          - [\"High-ability aberrant-pos\", \"1298\", \"[0.5, 1.0]\", \"[-15, +5]\", \"Mixed misfit direction\"]\n          - [\"Extreme over-consistent\", \"569\", \"[0.8, 2.5]\", \"[+5, +40]\", \"Possible contamination OR genuine expertise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot θ vs lz* for ~5800 models on MMLU, colored by cluster. 4 distinct regions visible. Overlay: theoretical null band (±1.96) contains <4% of points.\"\n      - \"Fig: Temporal trend — monthly median lz* (MMLU) from 2023-06 to 2024-12. Downward trend (more extreme misfit over time) with 95% CI band.\"\n      - \"Fig: Histogram of lz* values across all models×benchmarks (~22K data points). Extremely heavy tails compared to N(0,1) overlay. Quantifies universal misfit magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 成为 Angle B 的核心 empirical contribution。5800+ 模型的 psychometric profiling\n      在规模上无人匹及。但 detection 层面完全失败：当 96% 模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 失去了区分力。\n      Typology 中 \"extreme over-consistent\" cluster (569 models) 理论上最可能包含 contaminated 模型，\n      但无法验证（没有 ground truth）。这恰好呼应 Angle A：binary responses 信息不足以做可靠区分。\n      Temporal trend 是有趣的附带发现：模型能力提升的同时 4PL misfit 加剧，暗示 LLM 的进步方式\n      与经典 test-taker 的进步方式根本不同。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) 和 3PL (fixed d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异。\n      在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Simulation comparison ---\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.965\n      sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.013\n      sim_power_4pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.753\n      sim_power_3pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.741\n      # --- Real data comparison (Phase B 12 models) ---\n      flagged_rate_4pl: 0.950\n      flagged_rate_3pl: 0.933\n      lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.987\n      mean_abs_lz_diff: 0.42\n      # --- Controlled experiment (if available) ---\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_4pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.24\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_3pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.21\n      detection_improvement_from_d: \"negligible\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 feasibility parameter d 控制 high-ability examinees 在极难 items 上的 ceiling。\n      在经典 IRT 中，d<1 表示即使最强考生也不一定能答对最难题目，这对 LLM 很相关\n      （LLM 在某些极难 items 上确实表现不佳）。但 d 参数对 person-fit detection 的影响很小：\n      lz* 主要由 response pattern 的整体一致性驱动，而非单个 item 的 upper asymptote 建模。\n      4PL 和 3PL 的 lz* 高度相关（r=0.987），difference 不超过 0.5 个单位。\n      在 worst 档下，这个差异更加无关紧要——当 Δlz* 本身接近 noise floor 时，\n      item model 的微调不可能拯救 detection。结论：d parameter 不是检测力不足的原因。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Metric\", \"4PL\", \"3PL (d=1)\", \"Diff\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Simulation\", \"Power@15% MMLU\", \"0.978\", \"0.965\", \"-0.013\"]\n          - [\"Simulation\", \"Power@15% HellaSwag\", \"0.753\", \"0.741\", \"-0.012\"]\n          - [\"Real data\", \"Flag rate (12 models)\", \"95.0%\", \"93.3%\", \"-1.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Controlled\", \"Cohen's d@15% MMLU\", \"0.24\", \"0.21\", \"-0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for 60 (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect diagonal (r=0.987). Deviation from diagonal annotated for outlier cells.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 排除了 \"wrong IRT model\" 作为检测失败的解释。4PL vs 3PL 几乎不影响结果，\n      说明问题不在 item model specification 而在更根本的层面——binary response 的信息量。\n      这支持 Angle A 的 information-theoretic framing。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison (IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在控制实验的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，比较 IRT-FIT vs gray-box baselines 的\n      AUROC 和 Type-I error。量化 minimal-information operating point 的代价。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- AUROC comparison at 15% contamination (MMLU) ---\n      auroc_irt_fit_15pct_mmlu: 0.61\n      auroc_constat_15pct_mmlu: 0.89\n      auroc_minkpp_15pct_mmlu: 0.93\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_15pct: -0.32\n      # --- AUROC at 50% contamination ---\n      auroc_irt_fit_50pct_mmlu: 0.78\n      auroc_constat_50pct_mmlu: 0.96\n      auroc_minkpp_50pct_mmlu: 0.98\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_50pct: -0.20\n      # --- Type-I error at α=0.05 ---\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.08\n      type1_constat: 0.04\n      type1_minkpp: 0.03\n      # --- Cross-benchmark average ---\n      mean_auroc_irt_fit_15pct: 0.57\n      mean_auroc_constat_15pct: 0.86\n      mean_auroc_minkpp_15pct: 0.91\n      # --- Information access annotation ---\n      irt_fit_info_level: \"binary responses only\"\n      constat_info_level: \"binary responses + rephrased re-test\"\n      minkpp_info_level: \"token-level log-probabilities\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档最痛的结果：IRT-FIT 的 AUROC 与 baselines 差距 >30pp。\n      ConStat 通过 rephrased re-test 获得了 IRT-FIT 无法获取的关键信息——\n      如果模型记住了特定 item 的答案，换个说法后就答不出来，这种 inconsistency 在 binary response 层面可检测。\n      Min-K%++ 直接访问 token log-probabilities，能区分 \"seen in training\"（low perplexity on exact tokens）\n      和 \"genuinely knows\"（reasonable perplexity, correct reasoning）。\n      IRT-FIT 只有 binary correct/incorrect，根本没有这些信息。\n      但 Type-I error 略高（0.08 vs 0.03-0.04）也值得注意——universal misfit 导致 false alarm 偏多，\n      进一步削弱 practical utility。\n      关键 spin：这个 gap 不是 IRT-FIT 方法的 failure，而是 binary response 这个 information level 的\n      fundamental limitation。所有 binary-only 方法都会面临同样的 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method and Information Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"AUROC@15%\", \"AUROC@50%\", \"Type-I (α=0.05)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"Binary responses\", \"0.61\", \"0.78\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Binary + re-test\", \"0.89\", \"0.96\", \"0.04\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token log-probs\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"0.03\"]\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Benchmark (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"GSM8K\", \"Mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"0.61\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"0.89\", \"0.85\", \"0.83\", \"0.86\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"0.93\", \"0.91\", \"0.88\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection frontier diagram. X-axis = information access level (binary → re-test → log-probs → weights → training data). Y-axis = AUROC at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT at bottom-left, other methods along the frontier. Shaded region below IRT-FIT labeled 'binary-only ceiling'.\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves for 3 methods on MMLU at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve barely above diagonal, ConStat and Min-K%++ clearly separated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 是 Angle A 的 empirical backbone。30pp+ AUROC gap 直接量化了\n      binary-only operating point 的代价。但 narrative spin 至关重要：\n      这不是 \"our method is worse\"，而是 \"we establish the floor — ANY binary-only method\n      will hit this ceiling, and we prove it theoretically (simulation) and empirically (controlled exp).\"\n      Detection frontier diagram 将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量，\n      跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz* 提供 model-level 整体污染指标。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_phase_b: 12\n      lzm_mean: -14.8\n      lzm_std: 8.3\n      lzm_min: -31.2\n      lzm_max: 2.1\n      pct_significant_lzm: 91.7\n      # --- lzm vs individual lz* ---\n      lzm_improvement_over_best_single_benchmark_auroc: 0.02\n      lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n      # --- On controlled experiment data ---\n      lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.63\n      lzm_auroc_50pct: 0.80\n      lzm_improvement_over_single_benchmark_15pct: 0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      Multiscale aggregation 在 worst 档下几乎无帮助。理论上，如果 contamination 只影响特定 benchmark，\n      跨 benchmark 聚合应该通过 \"pooling signals\" 提高 detection power。但 worst 档的问题不是\n      signal 分散在多个 benchmark——而是每个 benchmark 上的 signal 本身就很弱。\n      Aggregating weak signals ≈ aggregating noise。lzm 与 mean lz* 高度相关（r=0.96），\n      说明聚合没有提取到新信息。AUROC 仅提升 2pp（0.61→0.63 at 15%），统计上不显著。\n      在 Phase B 12 模型上，91.7% 被 flagged——与单 benchmark 结果一致，universal misfit 在聚合后依然主导。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm Results (Phase B, 12 models)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"lzm\", \"p-value\", \"Flagged?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", \"-31.2\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"-22.7\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Claude-3.5-Sonnet\", \"-19.4\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"...(9 more)\", \"...\", \"...\", \"10 Yes, 1 No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of lzm by model (Phase B), sorted. Nearly all bars exceed significance threshold. Single unflagged model annotated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 不是 rescue path。当 individual signals 都是 noise 时，sophisticated aggregation 无法创造 signal。\n      但 lzm 可以作为 Angle B 的 supplementary metric——universal misfit 在 multiscale 聚合下仍然 dominant，\n      这 strengthens \"LLMs are fundamentally different from test-takers\" 的 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 (15%/50% MMLU) → GRPO RL training → 测量 lz* signal retention。\n      回应 Wang et al. (2025) 关于 MIA methods 在 post-RL 失效的问题。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Pre-RL (SFT contaminated) ---\n      lz_star_pre_rl_15pct: -17.1\n      lz_star_pre_rl_50pct: -14.6\n      delta_lz_pre_rl_15pct: 1.3\n      delta_lz_pre_rl_50pct: 3.8\n      # --- Post-RL ---\n      lz_star_post_rl_15pct: -19.8\n      lz_star_post_rl_50pct: -17.4\n      delta_lz_post_rl_15pct: -0.2\n      delta_lz_post_rl_50pct: 0.7\n      # --- Signal retention ---\n      signal_retention_15pct: 0.0\n      signal_retention_50pct: 0.03\n      post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_15pct: -0.008\n      post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_50pct: -0.012\n      # --- RL training details ---\n      rl_method: \"GRPO\"\n      rl_reward: \"rule-based (GSM8K format correctness + MATH answer match)\"\n      rl_steps: 2000\n      rl_epochs: 1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Post-RL signal retention 接近 0 是 worst 档的 defining prediction。\n      RL（特别是 GRPO）通过 reward shaping 重新优化模型的 response distribution，\n      这个过程 effectively \"forgets\" the specific item-level patterns that SFT might have created。\n      (1) RL 优化的是 reward signal 而非 specific item responses，所以 SFT 阶段可能存在的\n      item-level memorization 被 RL 的 exploration/exploitation 动态稀释。\n      (2) 在 worst 档，SFT contamination signal 本身就很弱（Δlz* at 15% = 1.3, p=0.38），\n      RL 只需要极小的 perturbation 就能完全消除。\n      (3) 即使 50% 污染（Δlz* = 3.8），RL 后 retention 也只有 3%（Δlz* 从 3.8 降到 0.7），\n      几乎完全不可检测。\n      (4) 有趣的是 accuracy 在 RL 后略微下降（-0.8pp to -1.2pp），\n      说明 RL reward signal（GSM8K/MATH）与 MMLU 不完全 aligned，\n      RL 牺牲了少量 MMLU 能力来获取 math reasoning 能力。\n      这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的结论一致：post-RL contamination 对所有 detection methods 都是严峻挑战。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"Δlz* pre-RL\", \"Δlz* post-RL\", \"Retention\", \"Acc Δ post-RL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"15%\", \"+1.3\", \"-0.2\", \"0%\", \"-0.8pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"+3.8\", \"+0.7\", \"3%\", \"-1.2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart showing Δlz* before and after RL for 15% and 50% contamination. Pre-RL bars already small; post-RL bars essentially zero. Annotated with Wang et al. (2025) MIA results for comparison.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验在 worst 档下结果完全消极但有很强的 narrative value：\n      它证明 binary-only detection 不仅在 SFT 阶段就很弱，在 realistic training pipeline（SFT → RL）下\n      完全失效。这 strengthens Angle A 的 \"fundamental information bottleneck\" claim。\n      对比 Wang et al.：他们证明 token-level MIA 在 post-RL 失效；我们证明 binary-level person-fit\n      在 post-RL 更彻底地失效——因为 binary 信息量更少。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH, MATH) Power Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      在 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 上运行 simulation power analysis，\n      填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证理论 power function。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- BBH ---\n      bbh_n_items: 6511\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.842\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.871\n      bbh_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.924\n      bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.855\n      bbh_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.02\n      # --- MATH ---\n      math_n_items: 5000\n      math_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.721\n      math_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.758\n      math_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.889\n      math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.740\n      math_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.03\n      # --- Power function validation ---\n      combined_R2_with_original_benchmarks: 0.963\n      sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n      # --- But: controlled experiment prediction ---\n      predicted_ctrl_auroc_bbh_15pct: 0.57\n      predicted_ctrl_auroc_math_15pct: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 填补了 GSM8K (1.3K) 和 MMLU (14K) 之间的 gap，在 simulation 中表现符合预期：\n      power ∝ √n_items，BBH (6.5K) 的 power 介于 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag 之间。\n      理论 power function（exp-power-theory）的预测与新 simulation 结果吻合（R² = 0.963），\n      证明 √n scaling law 在更广 item range 上成立。\n      但 worst 档的关键点是：这些 simulation power numbers 在 real SFT 下毫无意义。\n      即使 BBH simulation power = 87%，predicted controlled AUROC 仍然只有 0.57。\n      Simulation-reality gap 与 benchmark 大小无关——它由 SFT 泛化驱动，而非 statistical power。\n      这进一步支持 \"information bottleneck, not power bottleneck\" 的 narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Simulation Power for Extended Benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power @15%\", \"Theory @15%\", \"Predicted Real AUROC @15%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.591\", \"0.573\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", \"5000\", \"0.758\", \"0.740\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", \"6511\", \"0.871\", \"0.855\", \"0.57\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.753\", \"0.765\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.979\", \"0.61\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs n_items plot with original 5 benchmarks (circles) + BBH, MATH (triangles). Theoretical curve (solid line) fits well. Secondary y-axis or inset shows predicted real AUROC (flat near 0.55-0.61), illustrating that simulation power ≠ real detection ability.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Extra benchmarks 完成了 Claim 2 的 simulation-side story：power function 理论验证成功。\n      但在 worst 档下，这个 success 被 recontextualized 为 \"the theory works perfectly WITHIN the 4PL model;\n      the problem is that real SFT data violates 4PL in ways that destroy detection power regardless of n_items.\"\n      The decoupling of simulation power from real detection ability is itself a key finding.\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 misfit 的 domain-specific structure。\n      探测 Gemini-1.5 的 MMLU 污染模式。\n    expected_results:\n      n_domains: 57\n      n_supercategories: 4\n      # --- Domain-level misfit ---\n      pct_domains_flagged_gemini15: 100.0\n      pct_domains_flagged_median_model: 89.5\n      domain_lz_star_variance_across_domains: 8.7\n      # --- Supercategory breakdown (Gemini-1.5) ---\n      gemini15_lz_star_stem: 8.2\n      gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 7.4\n      gemini15_lz_star_social_science: 6.9\n      gemini15_lz_star_other: 5.8\n      # --- Domain-level Δlz* in controlled experiment ---\n      domain_delta_lz_cv_15pct: 1.35\n      n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_15pct: 0\n      n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_50pct: 3\n      # --- Cross-domain consistency ---\n      domain_lz_star_icc: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-level 分析在 worst 档下有两个发现：\n      (1) Universal misfit 是 universal——Gemini-1.5 在所有 57 个 MMLU domain 上都被 flagged，\n      不存在 \"clean domains\" 和 \"contaminated domains\" 的区分。其他模型类似，median 模型 90% domains 被 flagged。\n      这排除了 \"contamination is domain-specific\" 的假设——misfit 是 global LLM property。\n      (2) 在控制实验中，domain-level Δlz* 的 cross-domain CV = 1.35（极高），\n      说明污染 signal 在 domain 间分布极不均匀且方向不一致。15% 污染时没有任何 single domain 达到显著，\n      50% 时仅 3/57 domains 显著——因为每个 domain 只有 ~50-300 items，统计 power 极低。\n      Domain-level 分析无法 rescue detection，但支持 \"item count is key\" 的理论。\n      Gemini-1.5 跨 supercategory 的 lz* 分布（STEM > Humanities > Social Science > Other）\n      可能反映模型架构对不同知识类型的编码方式差异，而非污染模式——这是 Angle B 的 supplementary finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level lz* by Supercategory\"\n        columns: [\"Supercategory\", \"n_domains\", \"mean lz*\", \"min lz*\", \"max lz*\", \"% flagged\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"18\", \"8.2\", \"2.1\", \"15.3\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"13\", \"7.4\", \"1.8\", \"12.7\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Social Science\", \"12\", \"6.9\", \"1.5\", \"11.4\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"14\", \"5.8\", \"0.9\", \"10.2\", \"100%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* in Controlled Experiment (MMLU, 4-model avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"Domains significant (p<0.05)\", \"Domain Δlz* CV\", \"Max domain Cohen's d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"15%\", \"0 / 57\", \"1.35\", \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"3 / 57\", \"0.98\", \"0.72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of lz* across 12 models × 57 MMLU domains. Nearly all cells extreme (dark red/blue). Pattern: model-driven rows rather than domain-driven columns.\"\n      - \"Fig: Domain-level Δlz* distribution (box plot) at 15% and 50% contamination. 15%: boxes centered near 0 with wide spread. 50%: slight positive shift but high variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 确认 misfit 是 model-level phenomenon 而非 domain-specific。\n      这支持 Angle B 的 \"LLM response patterns are globally different from test-taker patterns\" 论点。\n      同时否定了 \"domain-specific contamination detection\" 作为 rescue strategy。\n      在 paper 中定位为 Angle B 的 supplementary evidence。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14991,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14991},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88299938-0f11-458b-bee8-afcd495816d0","uuid":"60d4a9d3-9c34-4023-9859-c107e6ec4f59"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":277874,"duration_api_ms":279284,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 detection claim 不成立。控制实验显示 SFT 泛化效应完全掩盖 Δlz* 信号：15% 污染的 Cohen's d < 0.3，\n  AUROC 接近 chance。50% 以下污染在所有 benchmark 均不可靠检测。必须 reframe 为 negative result paper：\n  (1) 建立 binary-response detection 的 information-theoretic lower bound，\n  (2) 将 universal model misfit 升级为独立 finding 并在 13K-model scale 刻画，\n  (3) detection frontier taxonomy 整合现有方法定位 IRT-FIT 的位置。\n  叙事核心转为 \"we tried the theoretically principled approach at the minimal-information operating point,\n  proved it cannot work under real SFT conditions, and explain exactly why — this is a warning to the community\n  that binary-only detection has a hard floor.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B 上用 QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz*。\n      3 independent runs per level 以估计 run-to-run variance。\n      这是整篇论文的 go/no-go gate。\n    expected_results:\n      n_runs_per_level: 3\n      # --- 0% (clean SFT baseline, non-MMLU data) ---\n      clean_sft_lz_star_mean: -18.4\n      clean_sft_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.2\n      clean_sft_accuracy_mmlu: 0.637\n      clean_sft_theta: 0.41\n      # --- 15% contamination ---\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -17.1\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.8\n      contam_15pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.661\n      contam_15pct_theta: 0.48\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: 1.3\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 0.22\n      delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: 0.38\n      # --- 50% contamination ---\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -14.6\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 4.1\n      contam_50pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.712\n      contam_50pct_theta: 0.62\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: 3.8\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 0.55\n      delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: 0.11\n      go_no_go_verdict: \"NO-GO for original detection claim\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      SFT 泛化效应是 worst 档的核心机制。即使只注入 15% MMLU items，QLoRA SFT 也带来全局知识能力提升\n      （accuracy +2.4pp），因为 MMLU 涵盖广泛学科知识，SFT on MMLU items 等价于 knowledge distillation。\n      这种全局能力提升使 θ 整体上移，而 θ 上移后模型在所有 item 上的表现都更好——包括未污染的 85% items。\n      结果是 lz* 的变化反映的不是 \"aberrant response pattern\"（答对不该答对的题），\n      而是 \"uniformly better response pattern\"（所有题都答得更好），后者在 person-fit 框架下是正常的高能力表现。\n      Run-to-run variance 来自 QLoRA 的随机初始化和 batch ordering，在小 epoch SFT 下显著（std ~3.5）。\n      15% 的 Δlz*=1.3 完全淹没在 run-to-run noise 中（Cohen's d=0.22, p=0.38）。\n      50% 时 Δlz*=3.8 略大但仍不显著（d=0.55, p=0.11），因为 50% 污染同时带来更大的泛化效应。\n      关键洞察：simulation 之所以 power=97.9% 是因为 simulation 中污染只改变被污染 items 的 response，\n      不改变未污染 items——即 no generalization。Real SFT 打破了这个假设。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pilot Δlz* Results (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam Level\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ\", \"lz* (mean±std)\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (clean SFT)\", \"0.637\", \"0.41\", \"-18.4 ± 3.2\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.661\", \"0.48\", \"-17.1 ± 3.8\", \"+1.3\", \"0.22\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.712\", \"0.62\", \"-14.6 ± 4.1\", \"+3.8\", \"0.55\", \"0.11\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Δlz* distribution across 3 runs per level, with overlapping violin plots showing 0%/15%/50%. 15% 和 0% 的分布几乎完全重叠，50% 略有偏移但仍有大量 overlap。附 simulation 预测 Δlz* 作为 dashed line 对比，显示 simulation-reality gap。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 结果明确：原始 detection claim 不成立。Simulation 预测 15% 污染应有 Δlz* ≈ -8.5（向负方向），\n      实际只有 +1.3（甚至方向都不对——因为泛化使 θ 升高，lz* 向正方向移动而非负方向）。\n      这是 fundamental information bottleneck：binary responses 无法区分 \"learned the specific items\"\n      和 \"learned the underlying knowledge\"。必须 pivot 到 negative result framing。\n      但这个 negative result 本身有价值：它证明 SFT contamination at ≤15% 在 binary-only operating point\n      是 fundamentally undetectable，不是方法不够好而是信息不够。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: >\n      4 模型 × 6 contamination levels × 3 benchmarks 的完整控制实验。\n      建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 映射全谱。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models: 4\n      models: [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"Gemma-4-31B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\"]\n      n_levels: 6\n      levels: [0, 5, 10, 15, 25, 50]\n      n_benchmarks: 3\n      benchmarks: [\"MMLU\", \"GSM8K\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n      n_runs_per_cell: 3\n      # --- Δlz* Cohen's d by level × benchmark (averaged across models) ---\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_mmlu:\n        5pct: 0.05\n        10pct: 0.12\n        15pct: 0.24\n        25pct: 0.38\n        50pct: 0.58\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_gsm8k:\n        5pct: 0.02\n        10pct: 0.08\n        15pct: 0.14\n        25pct: 0.22\n        50pct: 0.41\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_hellaswag:\n        5pct: 0.04\n        10pct: 0.10\n        15pct: 0.18\n        25pct: 0.30\n        50pct: 0.48\n      # --- AUROC (contaminated vs clean, per-run classification) ---\n      ctrl_auroc_mmlu:\n        5pct: 0.52\n        10pct: 0.56\n        15pct: 0.61\n        25pct: 0.68\n        50pct: 0.78\n      ctrl_auroc_gsm8k:\n        5pct: 0.50\n        10pct: 0.53\n        15pct: 0.55\n        25pct: 0.60\n        50pct: 0.69\n      ctrl_auroc_hellaswag:\n        5pct: 0.51\n        10pct: 0.55\n        15pct: 0.58\n        25pct: 0.64\n        50pct: 0.73\n      # --- 跨模型 variance ---\n      delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_mmlu: 0.85\n      delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_gsm8k: 1.12\n      # --- Minimum detectable contamination (AUROC > 0.8) ---\n      min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 55\n      min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 80\n      min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 65\n      # --- SFT generalization metrics ---\n      accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_mmlu: 0.0016\n      accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_gsm8k: 0.0021\n      accuracy_gain_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.035\n      theta_shift_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.15\n      # --- Cross-benchmark Δlz* consistency ---\n      ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.08\n      ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.22\n    result_rationale: >\n      四个模型的行为模式一致但 magnitude 差异大（CV=0.85-1.12），验证了 worst 档假设 \"run-to-run variance 太大\"。\n      核心原因：(1) SFT 泛化：每 1% MMLU 污染带来 0.16pp accuracy 提升，但其中大部分来自知识泛化而非 item 记忆。\n      Clean SFT（0% benchmark items）本身就提升 accuracy 3.5pp，说明 SFT format 本身就改善测试表现。\n      (2) Binary response 信息瓶颈：即使模型确实记住了特定 items，binary correct/incorrect 无法区分\n      \"记住答案\" 和 \"通过泛化学会推理\"。需要 response confidence (logits) 才能区分。\n      (3) 模型间差异：Gemma-4-31B 因参数量大，SFT 泛化效应最强（15% contam 几乎无 Δlz* 信号）；\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 泛化略弱但 run-to-run variance 更大（QLoRA rank 影响更显著）。\n      (4) Benchmark 大小效应被泛化抵消：理论上 MMLU (14K items) 应有最强信号，\n      实际上 MMLU 的知识广度也使泛化效应最强，两者部分抵消。\n      GSM8K 虽然只有 1.3K items，但数学推理的泛化结构不同（解题策略迁移更显著），信号更弱。\n      (5) 50% 污染时 AUROC 终于达到 0.78 (MMLU)，但这个 level 在实际 leaderboard gaming 中不现实——\n      没有人会 SFT 训练 50% 的 benchmark items，因为那等于直接在 test set 上 fine-tune，太明显了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Δlz* Cohen's d Matrix (4-model average)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"MMLU (14K)\", \"HellaSwag (10K)\", \"GSM8K (1.3K)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.05\", \"0.04\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"10%\", \"0.12\", \"0.10\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.24\", \"0.18\", \"0.14\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.38\", \"0.30\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.58\", \"0.48\", \"0.41\"]\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC for Contamination Detection via Δlz*\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"GSM8K\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", \"0.52\", \"0.51\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"10%\", \"0.56\", \"0.55\", \"0.53\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.61\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"0.68\", \"0.64\", \"0.60\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.78\", \"0.73\", \"0.69\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Model Δlz* at 15% Contamination (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Δlz* mean\", \"Δlz* std\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"+1.3\", \"3.8\", \"0.22\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"+1.8\", \"2.9\", \"0.31\", \"0.24\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"+0.6\", \"4.5\", \"0.09\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"+0.4\", \"3.1\", \"0.08\", \"0.78\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Simulation-vs-Reality gap plot. X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = detection power. Simulation curve (dashed) rises steeply to 97.9% at 15%. Reality curve (solid, with error bars across 4 models) stays near chance until ~50%. Gap annotation shows 'SFT generalization zone' shaded between curves.\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of AUROC across 4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks. Color scale 0.5 (red) to 1.0 (blue). Nearly all cells < 0.7 (red/orange), with only MMLU×50% cells approaching 0.8.\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-model Δlz* trajectories (line plot, 4 lines per benchmark). Error bands from 3 runs. Lines tangled near zero for <25%, diverge slightly at 50%. Illustrates cross-model inconsistency.\"\n    analysis: >\n      This is the central negative result. Simulation power of 97.9% at 15% assumed contamination only\n      affects contaminated items — real SFT violates this by improving performance on ALL items.\n      The simulation-reality gap is not a calibration issue (exp-empirical-null proved null is well-calibrated)\n      but a fundamental model mismatch: IRT person-fit detects aberrant patterns (getting hard items right\n      while missing easy ones), but SFT contamination produces uniformly-improved patterns, which are\n      indistinguishable from genuine ability gain in binary responses.\n      Min detectable contamination is 55-80% depending on benchmark — far above realistic contamination\n      scenarios. This establishes the detection frontier lower bound for binary-only methods.\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard-Scale Audit (Open LLM Leaderboard v1)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: >\n      对 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 13K+ 模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit statistics。\n      大规模 psychometric profiling: ability distribution, misfit typology, temporal trends。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_processed: 5847\n      n_models_excluded_missing_data: 3200\n      n_models_excluded_too_few_items: 1500\n      n_models_excluded_parse_errors: 2453\n      benchmarks_analyzed: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-Challenge\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      # --- Universal misfit confirmation at scale ---\n      pct_models_flagged_mmlu: 96.2\n      pct_models_flagged_hellaswag: 94.8\n      pct_models_flagged_arc_c: 88.5\n      pct_models_flagged_gsm8k: 91.3\n      pct_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 98.7\n      pct_models_flagged_all_benchmarks: 82.4\n      # --- lz* distribution statistics ---\n      lz_star_median_mmlu: -22.4\n      lz_star_median_hellaswag: -18.1\n      lz_star_iqr_mmlu: 15.3\n      lz_star_iqr_hellaswag: 12.8\n      # --- Ability (θ) distribution ---\n      theta_mean_mmlu: 0.28\n      theta_std_mmlu: 0.31\n      theta_median_mmlu: 0.22\n      theta_skewness_mmlu: 0.85\n      # --- Temporal trends (by model upload month) ---\n      mean_accuracy_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: 0.0042\n      mean_lz_star_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: -0.38\n      # --- Response pattern typology ---\n      n_clusters_identified: 4\n      cluster_labels: [\"Low-ability consistent\", \"Mid-ability aberrant-negative\", \"High-ability aberrant-positive\", \"Extreme-ability over-consistent\"]\n      cluster_sizes: [2104, 1876, 1298, 569]\n      # --- Cross-benchmark contamination detection (unreliable) ---\n      cross_benchmark_spearman_lz_significant_frac: 0.12\n      n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_any: 312\n      n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_multiple: 47\n      # --- Specific anomaly examples ---\n      top_anomalous_models_count: 15\n      gemini15_in_dataset: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据处理是主要瓶颈：13K+ 模型中约 45% 因数据质量问题（items 缺失、格式异常、重复提交）被排除，\n      最终 ~5800 模型可用。这仍远超任何现有 person-fit 研究的规模。\n      Universal misfit 在大规模下得到压倒性确认：96-99% 模型被 flagged。但这恰恰是问题——\n      当几乎所有模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 无法区分 contaminated 和 clean 模型。\n      Temporal trend 显示 mean accuracy 随时间上升（能力通胀），同时 lz* 变得更极端（misfit 加剧），\n      这与 SFT 泛化假设一致：更强的 SFT 技术 → 更大的 4PL violation。\n      4 类 response pattern typology 是 Angle B 的核心 contribution，\n      但无法从 typology 中可靠识别 contamination——\"aberrant-positive\" cluster 包含真正高能力模型和可能被污染的模型，\n      binary responses 无法区分。\n      Cross-benchmark consistency 很弱（12% significant），进一步证明 lz* 不是 contamination 的可靠指标，\n      而是模型-benchmark interaction 的复杂函数。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Universal Misfit at Leaderboard Scale\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_models\", \"% flagged (|lz*|>3)\", \"median lz*\", \"IQR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"5847\", \"96.2%\", \"-22.4\", \"15.3\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"5612\", \"94.8%\", \"-18.1\", \"12.8\"]\n          - [\"ARC-Challenge\", \"5234\", \"88.5%\", \"-8.7\", \"7.2\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"4891\", \"91.3%\", \"-11.5\", \"9.4\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Response Pattern Typology (K-means, k=4)\"\n        columns: [\"Cluster\", \"n_models\", \"θ range\", \"lz* range\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Low-ability consistent\", \"2104\", \"[-0.5, 0.1]\", \"[-8, -2]\", \"Weak models, mild misfit\"]\n          - [\"Mid-ability aberrant-neg\", \"1876\", \"[0.1, 0.5]\", \"[-35, -10]\", \"Strong negative aberrance\"]\n          - [\"High-ability aberrant-pos\", \"1298\", \"[0.5, 1.0]\", \"[-15, +5]\", \"Mixed misfit direction\"]\n          - [\"Extreme over-consistent\", \"569\", \"[0.8, 2.5]\", \"[+5, +40]\", \"Possible contamination OR genuine expertise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot θ vs lz* for ~5800 models on MMLU, colored by cluster. 4 distinct regions visible. Overlay: theoretical null band (±1.96) contains <4% of points.\"\n      - \"Fig: Temporal trend — monthly median lz* (MMLU) from 2023-06 to 2024-12. Downward trend (more extreme misfit over time) with 95% CI band.\"\n      - \"Fig: Histogram of lz* values across all models×benchmarks (~22K data points). Extremely heavy tails compared to N(0,1) overlay. Quantifies universal misfit magnitude.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 成为 Angle B 的核心 empirical contribution。5800+ 模型的 psychometric profiling\n      在规模上无人匹及。但 detection 层面完全失败：当 96% 模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 失去了区分力。\n      Typology 中 \"extreme over-consistent\" cluster (569 models) 理论上最可能包含 contaminated 模型，\n      但无法验证（没有 ground truth）。这恰好呼应 Angle A：binary responses 信息不足以做可靠区分。\n      Temporal trend 是有趣的附带发现：模型能力提升的同时 4PL misfit 加剧，暗示 LLM 的进步方式\n      与经典 test-taker 的进步方式根本不同。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: >\n      比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) 和 3PL (fixed d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异。\n      在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Simulation comparison ---\n      sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n      sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.965\n      sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.013\n      sim_power_4pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.753\n      sim_power_3pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.741\n      # --- Real data comparison (Phase B 12 models) ---\n      flagged_rate_4pl: 0.950\n      flagged_rate_3pl: 0.933\n      lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.987\n      mean_abs_lz_diff: 0.42\n      # --- Controlled experiment (if available) ---\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_4pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.24\n      delta_lz_cohen_d_3pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.21\n      detection_improvement_from_d: \"negligible\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 feasibility parameter d 控制 high-ability examinees 在极难 items 上的 ceiling。\n      在经典 IRT 中，d<1 表示即使最强考生也不一定能答对最难题目，这对 LLM 很相关\n      （LLM 在某些极难 items 上确实表现不佳）。但 d 参数对 person-fit detection 的影响很小：\n      lz* 主要由 response pattern 的整体一致性驱动，而非单个 item 的 upper asymptote 建模。\n      4PL 和 3PL 的 lz* 高度相关（r=0.987），difference 不超过 0.5 个单位。\n      在 worst 档下，这个差异更加无关紧要——当 Δlz* 本身接近 noise floor 时，\n      item model 的微调不可能拯救 detection。结论：d parameter 不是检测力不足的原因。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Metric\", \"4PL\", \"3PL (d=1)\", \"Diff\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Simulation\", \"Power@15% MMLU\", \"0.978\", \"0.965\", \"-0.013\"]\n          - [\"Simulation\", \"Power@15% HellaSwag\", \"0.753\", \"0.741\", \"-0.012\"]\n          - [\"Real data\", \"Flag rate (12 models)\", \"95.0%\", \"93.3%\", \"-1.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Controlled\", \"Cohen's d@15% MMLU\", \"0.24\", \"0.21\", \"-0.03\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for 60 (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect diagonal (r=0.987). Deviation from diagonal annotated for outlier cells.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 排除了 \"wrong IRT model\" 作为检测失败的解释。4PL vs 3PL 几乎不影响结果，\n      说明问题不在 item model specification 而在更根本的层面——binary response 的信息量。\n      这支持 Angle A 的 information-theoretic framing。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison (IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      在控制实验的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，比较 IRT-FIT vs gray-box baselines 的\n      AUROC 和 Type-I error。量化 minimal-information operating point 的代价。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- AUROC comparison at 15% contamination (MMLU) ---\n      auroc_irt_fit_15pct_mmlu: 0.61\n      auroc_constat_15pct_mmlu: 0.89\n      auroc_minkpp_15pct_mmlu: 0.93\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_15pct: -0.32\n      # --- AUROC at 50% contamination ---\n      auroc_irt_fit_50pct_mmlu: 0.78\n      auroc_constat_50pct_mmlu: 0.96\n      auroc_minkpp_50pct_mmlu: 0.98\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_50pct: -0.20\n      # --- Type-I error at α=0.05 ---\n      type1_irt_fit: 0.08\n      type1_constat: 0.04\n      type1_minkpp: 0.03\n      # --- Cross-benchmark average ---\n      mean_auroc_irt_fit_15pct: 0.57\n      mean_auroc_constat_15pct: 0.86\n      mean_auroc_minkpp_15pct: 0.91\n      # --- Information access annotation ---\n      irt_fit_info_level: \"binary responses only\"\n      constat_info_level: \"binary responses + rephrased re-test\"\n      minkpp_info_level: \"token-level log-probabilities\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 worst 档最痛的结果：IRT-FIT 的 AUROC 与 baselines 差距 >30pp。\n      ConStat 通过 rephrased re-test 获得了 IRT-FIT 无法获取的关键信息——\n      如果模型记住了特定 item 的答案，换个说法后就答不出来，这种 inconsistency 在 binary response 层面可检测。\n      Min-K%++ 直接访问 token log-probabilities，能区分 \"seen in training\"（low perplexity on exact tokens）\n      和 \"genuinely knows\"（reasonable perplexity, correct reasoning）。\n      IRT-FIT 只有 binary correct/incorrect，根本没有这些信息。\n      但 Type-I error 略高（0.08 vs 0.03-0.04）也值得注意——universal misfit 导致 false alarm 偏多，\n      进一步削弱 practical utility。\n      关键 spin：这个 gap 不是 IRT-FIT 方法的 failure，而是 binary response 这个 information level 的\n      fundamental limitation。所有 binary-only 方法都会面临同样的 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method and Information Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"AUROC@15%\", \"AUROC@50%\", \"Type-I (α=0.05)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"Binary responses\", \"0.61\", \"0.78\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Binary + re-test\", \"0.89\", \"0.96\", \"0.04\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token log-probs\", \"0.93\", \"0.98\", \"0.03\"]\n      - name: \"Table: AUROC by Benchmark (15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"GSM8K\", \"Mean\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT\", \"0.61\", \"0.58\", \"0.55\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"0.89\", \"0.85\", \"0.83\", \"0.86\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"0.93\", \"0.91\", \"0.88\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Detection frontier diagram. X-axis = information access level (binary → re-test → log-probs → weights → training data). Y-axis = AUROC at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT at bottom-left, other methods along the frontier. Shaded region below IRT-FIT labeled 'binary-only ceiling'.\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves for 3 methods on MMLU at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve barely above diagonal, ConStat and Min-K%++ clearly separated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 是 Angle A 的 empirical backbone。30pp+ AUROC gap 直接量化了\n      binary-only operating point 的代价。但 narrative spin 至关重要：\n      这不是 \"our method is worse\"，而是 \"we establish the floor — ANY binary-only method\n      will hit this ceiling, and we prove it theoretically (simulation) and empirically (controlled exp).\"\n      Detection frontier diagram 将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: >\n      实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量，\n      跨 benchmark 聚合标准化 lz* 提供 model-level 整体污染指标。\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_phase_b: 12\n      lzm_mean: -14.8\n      lzm_std: 8.3\n      lzm_min: -31.2\n      lzm_max: 2.1\n      pct_significant_lzm: 91.7\n      # --- lzm vs individual lz* ---\n      lzm_improvement_over_best_single_benchmark_auroc: 0.02\n      lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n      # --- On controlled experiment data ---\n      lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.63\n      lzm_auroc_50pct: 0.80\n      lzm_improvement_over_single_benchmark_15pct: 0.02\n    result_rationale: >\n      Multiscale aggregation 在 worst 档下几乎无帮助。理论上，如果 contamination 只影响特定 benchmark，\n      跨 benchmark 聚合应该通过 \"pooling signals\" 提高 detection power。但 worst 档的问题不是\n      signal 分散在多个 benchmark——而是每个 benchmark 上的 signal 本身就很弱。\n      Aggregating weak signals ≈ aggregating noise。lzm 与 mean lz* 高度相关（r=0.96），\n      说明聚合没有提取到新信息。AUROC 仅提升 2pp（0.61→0.63 at 15%），统计上不显著。\n      在 Phase B 12 模型上，91.7% 被 flagged——与单 benchmark 结果一致，universal misfit 在聚合后依然主导。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: lzm Results (Phase B, 12 models)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"lzm\", \"p-value\", \"Flagged?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", \"-31.2\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o\", \"-22.7\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Claude-3.5-Sonnet\", \"-19.4\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"...(9 more)\", \"...\", \"...\", \"10 Yes, 1 No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of lzm by model (Phase B), sorted. Nearly all bars exceed significance threshold. Single unflagged model annotated.\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 不是 rescue path。当 individual signals 都是 noise 时，sophisticated aggregation 无法创造 signal。\n      但 lzm 可以作为 Angle B 的 supplementary metric——universal misfit 在 multiscale 聚合下仍然 dominant，\n      这 strengthens \"LLMs are fundamentally different from test-takers\" 的 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 (15%/50% MMLU) → GRPO RL training → 测量 lz* signal retention。\n      回应 Wang et al. (2025) 关于 MIA methods 在 post-RL 失效的问题。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- Pre-RL (SFT contaminated) ---\n      lz_star_pre_rl_15pct: -17.1\n      lz_star_pre_rl_50pct: -14.6\n      delta_lz_pre_rl_15pct: 1.3\n      delta_lz_pre_rl_50pct: 3.8\n      # --- Post-RL ---\n      lz_star_post_rl_15pct: -19.8\n      lz_star_post_rl_50pct: -17.4\n      delta_lz_post_rl_15pct: -0.2\n      delta_lz_post_rl_50pct: 0.7\n      # --- Signal retention ---\n      signal_retention_15pct: 0.0\n      signal_retention_50pct: 0.03\n      post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_15pct: -0.008\n      post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_50pct: -0.012\n      # --- RL training details ---\n      rl_method: \"GRPO\"\n      rl_reward: \"rule-based (GSM8K format correctness + MATH answer match)\"\n      rl_steps: 2000\n      rl_epochs: 1\n    result_rationale: >\n      Post-RL signal retention 接近 0 是 worst 档的 defining prediction。\n      RL（特别是 GRPO）通过 reward shaping 重新优化模型的 response distribution，\n      这个过程 effectively \"forgets\" the specific item-level patterns that SFT might have created。\n      (1) RL 优化的是 reward signal 而非 specific item responses，所以 SFT 阶段可能存在的\n      item-level memorization 被 RL 的 exploration/exploitation 动态稀释。\n      (2) 在 worst 档，SFT contamination signal 本身就很弱（Δlz* at 15% = 1.3, p=0.38），\n      RL 只需要极小的 perturbation 就能完全消除。\n      (3) 即使 50% 污染（Δlz* = 3.8），RL 后 retention 也只有 3%（Δlz* 从 3.8 降到 0.7），\n      几乎完全不可检测。\n      (4) 有趣的是 accuracy 在 RL 后略微下降（-0.8pp to -1.2pp），\n      说明 RL reward signal（GSM8K/MATH）与 MMLU 不完全 aligned，\n      RL 牺牲了少量 MMLU 能力来获取 math reasoning 能力。\n      这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的结论一致：post-RL contamination 对所有 detection methods 都是严峻挑战。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"Δlz* pre-RL\", \"Δlz* post-RL\", \"Retention\", \"Acc Δ post-RL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"15%\", \"+1.3\", \"-0.2\", \"0%\", \"-0.8pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"+3.8\", \"+0.7\", \"3%\", \"-1.2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart showing Δlz* before and after RL for 15% and 50% contamination. Pre-RL bars already small; post-RL bars essentially zero. Annotated with Wang et al. (2025) MIA results for comparison.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验在 worst 档下结果完全消极但有很强的 narrative value：\n      它证明 binary-only detection 不仅在 SFT 阶段就很弱，在 realistic training pipeline（SFT → RL）下\n      完全失效。这 strengthens Angle A 的 \"fundamental information bottleneck\" claim。\n      对比 Wang et al.：他们证明 token-level MIA 在 post-RL 失效；我们证明 binary-level person-fit\n      在 post-RL 更彻底地失效——因为 binary 信息量更少。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH, MATH) Power Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: >\n      在 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 上运行 simulation power analysis，\n      填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证理论 power function。\n    expected_results:\n      # --- BBH ---\n      bbh_n_items: 6511\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.842\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.871\n      bbh_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.924\n      bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.855\n      bbh_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.02\n      # --- MATH ---\n      math_n_items: 5000\n      math_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.721\n      math_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.758\n      math_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.889\n      math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.740\n      math_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.03\n      # --- Power function validation ---\n      combined_R2_with_original_benchmarks: 0.963\n      sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n      # --- But: controlled experiment prediction ---\n      predicted_ctrl_auroc_bbh_15pct: 0.57\n      predicted_ctrl_auroc_math_15pct: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 填补了 GSM8K (1.3K) 和 MMLU (14K) 之间的 gap，在 simulation 中表现符合预期：\n      power ∝ √n_items，BBH (6.5K) 的 power 介于 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag 之间。\n      理论 power function（exp-power-theory）的预测与新 simulation 结果吻合（R² = 0.963），\n      证明 √n scaling law 在更广 item range 上成立。\n      但 worst 档的关键点是：这些 simulation power numbers 在 real SFT 下毫无意义。\n      即使 BBH simulation power = 87%，predicted controlled AUROC 仍然只有 0.57。\n      Simulation-reality gap 与 benchmark 大小无关——它由 SFT 泛化驱动，而非 statistical power。\n      这进一步支持 \"information bottleneck, not power bottleneck\" 的 narrative。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Simulation Power for Extended Benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim Power @15%\", \"Theory @15%\", \"Predicted Real AUROC @15%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.591\", \"0.573\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"MATH\", \"5000\", \"0.758\", \"0.740\", \"0.55\"]\n          - [\"BBH\", \"6511\", \"0.871\", \"0.855\", \"0.57\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.753\", \"0.765\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.979\", \"0.61\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Power vs n_items plot with original 5 benchmarks (circles) + BBH, MATH (triangles). Theoretical curve (solid line) fits well. Secondary y-axis or inset shows predicted real AUROC (flat near 0.55-0.61), illustrating that simulation power ≠ real detection ability.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Extra benchmarks 完成了 Claim 2 的 simulation-side story：power function 理论验证成功。\n      但在 worst 档下，这个 success 被 recontextualized 为 \"the theory works perfectly WITHIN the 4PL model;\n      the problem is that real SFT data violates 4PL in ways that destroy detection power regardless of n_items.\"\n      The decoupling of simulation power from real detection ability is itself a key finding.\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 misfit 的 domain-specific structure。\n      探测 Gemini-1.5 的 MMLU 污染模式。\n    expected_results:\n      n_domains: 57\n      n_supercategories: 4\n      # --- Domain-level misfit ---\n      pct_domains_flagged_gemini15: 100.0\n      pct_domains_flagged_median_model: 89.5\n      domain_lz_star_variance_across_domains: 8.7\n      # --- Supercategory breakdown (Gemini-1.5) ---\n      gemini15_lz_star_stem: 8.2\n      gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 7.4\n      gemini15_lz_star_social_science: 6.9\n      gemini15_lz_star_other: 5.8\n      # --- Domain-level Δlz* in controlled experiment ---\n      domain_delta_lz_cv_15pct: 1.35\n      n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_15pct: 0\n      n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_50pct: 3\n      # --- Cross-domain consistency ---\n      domain_lz_star_icc: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-level 分析在 worst 档下有两个发现：\n      (1) Universal misfit 是 universal——Gemini-1.5 在所有 57 个 MMLU domain 上都被 flagged，\n      不存在 \"clean domains\" 和 \"contaminated domains\" 的区分。其他模型类似，median 模型 90% domains 被 flagged。\n      这排除了 \"contamination is domain-specific\" 的假设——misfit 是 global LLM property。\n      (2) 在控制实验中，domain-level Δlz* 的 cross-domain CV = 1.35（极高），\n      说明污染 signal 在 domain 间分布极不均匀且方向不一致。15% 污染时没有任何 single domain 达到显著，\n      50% 时仅 3/57 domains 显著——因为每个 domain 只有 ~50-300 items，统计 power 极低。\n      Domain-level 分析无法 rescue detection，但支持 \"item count is key\" 的理论。\n      Gemini-1.5 跨 supercategory 的 lz* 分布（STEM > Humanities > Social Science > Other）\n      可能反映模型架构对不同知识类型的编码方式差异，而非污染模式——这是 Angle B 的 supplementary finding。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level lz* by Supercategory\"\n        columns: [\"Supercategory\", \"n_domains\", \"mean lz*\", \"min lz*\", \"max lz*\", \"% flagged\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"18\", \"8.2\", \"2.1\", \"15.3\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"13\", \"7.4\", \"1.8\", \"12.7\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Social Science\", \"12\", \"6.9\", \"1.5\", \"11.4\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"14\", \"5.8\", \"0.9\", \"10.2\", \"100%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Domain-Level Δlz* in Controlled Experiment (MMLU, 4-model avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Contam %\", \"Domains significant (p<0.05)\", \"Domain Δlz* CV\", \"Max domain Cohen's d\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"15%\", \"0 / 57\", \"1.35\", \"0.41\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"3 / 57\", \"0.98\", \"0.72\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap of lz* across 12 models × 57 MMLU domains. Nearly all cells extreme (dark red/blue). Pattern: model-driven rows rather than domain-driven columns.\"\n      - \"Fig: Domain-level Δlz* distribution (box plot) at 15% and 50% contamination. 15%: boxes centered near 0 with wide spread. 50%: slight positive shift but high variance.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain analysis 确认 misfit 是 model-level phenomenon 而非 domain-specific。\n      这支持 Angle B 的 \"LLM response patterns are globally different from test-taker patterns\" 论点。\n      同时否定了 \"domain-specific contamination detection\" 作为 rescue strategy。\n      在 paper 中定位为 Angle B 的 supplementary evidence。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"88299938-0f11-458b-bee8-afcd495816d0","total_cost_usd":0.46464725,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14991,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":14199,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14991,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14199,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14991},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9953,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010048,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14199,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14991,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.45459925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4e952fab-051e-43e8-946a-29c1155fd34a"}
